,8.75rem)] font-medium uppercase leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.03em]" data-ph-title="true" id="page-title">Dining &amp; Stays</h1><div class="mt-7 flex flex-col gap-6 border-t border-bone/20 pt-5 lg:mt-9 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between"><div class="flex items-end gap-6"><button aria-label="Scroll to the next section" class="group/cue hidden items-center sm:flex" data-ph-fade="true" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="relative block h-10 w-px overflow-hidden bg-bone/25"><span class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 block h-1/2 animate-scroll-cue bg-bone"></span></span></button><p class="max-w-xl font-serif text-[clamp(1.35rem,2.2vw,2rem)] italic leading-snug text-bone/90" data-ph-fade="true">Long lunches, late light and twenty-four lodges among the pines.</p></div><dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-5 sm:gap-8 lg:shrink-0" data-ph-fade="true"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">Venues</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">4</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">Terrace seats</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">96</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse gap-1.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-bone/60 sm:text-[10px]">Lodges</dt><dd class="type-wide text-lg font-medium leading-none sm:text-2xl">24</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="dining-intro-label" class="relative z-10 -mt-px overflow-hidden rounded-t-[1.75rem] bg-bone text-charcoal shadow-[0_-30px_70px_-20px_rgba(9,17,12,0.55)] sm:rounded-t-[2.5rem]" id="dining-intro"><div class="px-5 pb-24 pt-20 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-32 lg:pt-28"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70" id="dining-intro-label"><span class="tabular-nums">01</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>The kitchen</span></h2><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-muted-foreground">Garden · Harbour · Valley</p></div><p class="mt-12 max-w-[68rem] text-[clamp(1.6rem,3.5vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em] lg:mt-16 [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" data-intro-statement="true">Everything on the plate travels <em>less than forty kilometres</em>, and most of it less than four.</p><div class="mt-16 grid gap-12 lg:mt-20 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><p class="max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75 lg:col-span-4" data-reveal="true">The kitchen cooks with whatever the estate garden, the harbour boats and the farms of the valley bring in that morning. The fire is lit at six, the bread comes out at eight and the menu is written at nine.</p><div class="lg:col-span-8"><dl class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">is the furthest anything on the plate travels</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="40" data-decimals="0">40</span> km</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">places to eat, drink and stay across the estate</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="4" data-decimals="0">4</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">seats on the Terrace, inside and out</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="96" data-decimals="0">96</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse border-t border-charcoal/15 pt-4" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-sm leading-snug text-charcoal/65">timber lodges among the pines</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.2vw,3rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="24" data-decimals="0">24</span></span></dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="dining-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-sand text-charcoal" id="dining"><div class="px-5 pt-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pt-36"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-6"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">02</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Dining &amp; hospitality</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.4rem,5vw,5rem)] font-light leading-[1] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="dining-heading">Long lunches. <em class="font-serif font-normal">Late light.</em></h2><p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal/75" data-reveal="true">Four places to eat, drink and stay, each one looking out over the course. The menus follow the estate garden and the boats that land along the coast each morning.</p></div><figure class="lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/3] rounded-[4px] lg:aspect-[4/5]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="6"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A seared scallop with prawns and fresh leaves on a white plate" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30vw, 100vw" src="/images/dining-plate-2.